# Photon Blast Barrage: "When you cast this spell, copy it X times. You may choose new targets for the copies. Photon Blast Barrage
# deals 1 damage to target creature." Bot1 casts it with X = 2 (all four Moxen: {2}{R}{R}) at Bot2's Grizzly Bears (2/2). The
# trigger makes two copies: the first is aimed at Bot2's Memnite (1/1), the second keeps the Bears. The Memnite dies to 1 damage and
# the Bears take 1 from the copy and 1 from the original - exactly their toughness, so with one copy too few they would live.

